WEBVTT

01:49.500 --> 01:55.000
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:58.020
[Episode 20]

01:58.070 --> 02:02.330
[Song Residence]

02:07.310 --> 02:08.440
How come it's you?

02:13.800 --> 02:15.630
Miss Song Yiting, you gave me
such generous gifts.

02:15.630 --> 02:16.910
How could I not come?

02:17.710 --> 02:19.630
I want to see Li Shiliu.

02:20.870 --> 02:22.360
Chief is extremely busy,

02:22.360 --> 02:24.380
so he assigned this matter to me.

02:24.680 --> 02:26.630
Miss Yiting, feel free
to make any requests.

02:26.630 --> 02:27.470
I'll certainly comply.

02:27.470 --> 02:28.530
Don't call me that.

02:28.910 --> 02:29.710
And also,

02:30.400 --> 02:31.530
keep your distance.

02:37.360 --> 02:38.760
Let me be honest with you.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.960
Today, only Li Shiliu

02:41.000 --> 02:42.560
can take what I have in my possession.

02:42.560 --> 02:44.360
That's a bit unreasonable, isn't it?

02:44.360 --> 02:46.190
That belongs to Waning River Crescent.

02:46.190 --> 02:46.910
Is that so?

02:48.120 --> 02:50.180
It belongs to Waning River Crescent?

02:53.030 --> 02:53.840
Either

02:54.310 --> 02:56.030
you let me see Li Shiliu today,

02:57.079 --> 02:57.870
or

02:58.630 --> 03:00.310
Mr. Chu from the
capital prefecture's office

03:00.310 --> 03:02.110
would be very interested to know

03:02.120 --> 03:03.470
how his precious sword

03:03.560 --> 03:05.240
ended up in your hands.

03:06.840 --> 03:08.560
I bathed myself and put on perfume

03:08.560 --> 03:10.310
only to encounter such filth.

03:10.470 --> 03:11.560
What rotten luck.

03:18.020 --> 03:18.340
[Noon]

03:18.360 --> 03:18.990
[Early Afternoon]

03:19.010 --> 03:19.720
[Late Afternoon]

03:19.760 --> 03:21.410
[Evening]

03:22.590 --> 03:24.050
I can't take this anymore.

03:24.190 --> 03:25.150
An official's daughter

03:25.150 --> 03:27.030
dares to double-cross the Nightwalkers.

03:27.030 --> 03:28.360
I'm going to
take that sword back right now.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.590
I'll take all the blame
if anything goes wrong.

03:29.590 --> 03:31.000
Can you calm down?

03:31.000 --> 03:32.000
You think the Song Residence is some gang

03:32.000 --> 03:32.840
you can just barge into?

03:32.840 --> 03:33.870
Listen.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.280
When dealing with officials' families,

03:35.280 --> 03:36.710
we need to follow proper protocol.

03:36.710 --> 03:38.280
Then what do you suggest we do?

03:38.280 --> 03:39.800
If we don't get that sword back,

03:39.800 --> 03:41.800
we can't hide it from Chief anymore.

03:45.120 --> 03:46.590
Bring me my battle robe.

03:47.150 --> 03:48.400
At critical moments,

03:49.310 --> 03:51.240
I'm still the one who has to step in.

04:09.030 --> 04:09.840
Thank you,

04:10.080 --> 04:11.080
Miss Song Yiting.

04:12.280 --> 04:13.870
Mr. Li, why so formal?

04:14.280 --> 04:15.560
Just call me Yiting.

04:17.230 --> 04:18.160
Miss Yiting, feel free...

04:18.160 --> 04:19.220
Don't call me that.

04:19.600 --> 04:20.730
Keep your distance.

04:24.160 --> 04:25.830
My Lady, what exactly would it take

04:25.830 --> 04:27.230
for you to return

04:27.360 --> 04:28.890
what you've stolen from me?

04:29.160 --> 04:30.630
How can you call it stealing?

04:30.630 --> 04:31.830
That sounds so harsh.

04:32.070 --> 04:34.630
I gifted you 73 paintings

04:34.750 --> 04:35.560
and merely took

04:35.560 --> 04:37.830
a small token in return.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.750
If you're so attached to it,

04:39.750 --> 04:41.630
perhaps we could arrange a trade?

04:45.600 --> 04:47.800
Offering yourself in marriage is
certainly out of the question.

04:47.800 --> 04:51.360
The Waning River Crescent doesn't engage
in such transactions.

04:51.360 --> 04:52.630
You jest, Mr. Li.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.159
It's not that serious.

04:54.830 --> 04:57.000
I only ask for three days.

04:57.750 --> 04:58.920
You need three days?

05:03.630 --> 05:04.760
You misunderstand.

05:05.270 --> 05:06.680
You were right before.

05:07.040 --> 05:09.360
I have no experience
with the martial arts world,

05:09.360 --> 05:11.240
and you don't understand
noble family customs.

05:11.240 --> 05:13.360
Our backgrounds are worlds apart,

05:13.600 --> 05:15.930
so this relationship may not be suitable.

05:17.160 --> 05:20.560
But if we don't even give
each other a chance,

05:21.070 --> 05:24.000
then there's definitely
no possibility of a future.

05:24.710 --> 05:27.150
How do you propose we try?

05:27.800 --> 05:29.240
Let's spend three days together

05:29.240 --> 05:31.100
to get to know each other's lives.

05:31.680 --> 05:33.070
If after three days,

05:33.240 --> 05:35.000
you still feel nothing for me,

05:35.270 --> 05:36.720
I'll return the sword.

05:37.270 --> 05:38.750
But if you do fall for me,

05:39.430 --> 05:41.550
then you must ask my parents for my hand.

05:41.550 --> 05:42.580
For your hand?

05:43.120 --> 05:44.310
Playing for such high stakes?

05:43.870 --> 05:47.159
♪ Clap once, we ride together
in the bridal sedan ♪

05:45.159 --> 05:47.560
You've experienced all sorts of things.

05:47.870 --> 05:49.360
Surely this small request

05:48.070 --> 05:51.510
♪ Clap twice,
the Song family's rocket shoots high ♪

05:49.950 --> 05:51.610
doesn't frighten you, right?

05:52.170 --> 05:53.180
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

05:53.740 --> 05:54.740
♪ Riding in the bridal sedan ♪

05:55.560 --> 05:56.730
♪ The bridal sedan is fabulous ♪

06:14.320 --> 06:16.750
Rather than handing over Miss Song Yiting

06:16.750 --> 06:18.600
to strengthen someone else's power,

06:18.600 --> 06:21.190
why don't you marry both sisters?

06:21.680 --> 06:22.950
Marry a virtuous wife

06:23.750 --> 06:25.350
and have a pretty concubine.

06:26.000 --> 06:29.130
Firmly grasp the Song family's influence
in your hands.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.680
My answer

06:32.070 --> 06:33.270
is still the same.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.240
Very well.

06:40.870 --> 06:42.070
Nan Heng clearly has

06:42.070 --> 06:43.950
the idea of us sisters marrying
one husband.

06:43.950 --> 06:45.690
Is there no way to avoid

06:46.040 --> 06:48.100
these iconic scenes from the script?

07:04.430 --> 07:06.230
The palace is full of treachery.

07:06.340 --> 07:08.140
One must be careful everywhere.

07:08.270 --> 07:09.510
Even if you don't harm others,

07:09.510 --> 07:11.830
you must guard against others harming you.

07:11.830 --> 07:13.510
He may not want to kill me,

07:14.070 --> 07:16.270
but I will certainly die because of him.

07:16.630 --> 07:17.510
These are the rules.

07:17.510 --> 07:18.390
It's destined.

07:18.920 --> 07:19.950
Then, break the rules.

07:19.950 --> 07:21.410
Destroy what's destined.

07:25.830 --> 07:26.630
No.

07:26.800 --> 07:29.160
At least I can survive until
the second-to-last episode.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.830
But if Song Yiting is deceived by him,

07:30.830 --> 07:32.600
that's a lifetime matter.

07:33.480 --> 07:35.390
I must defy fate.

07:36.750 --> 07:37.560
Nan Heng,

07:38.159 --> 07:39.070
I'm sorry.

07:47.750 --> 07:48.680
My Lady.

07:49.310 --> 07:50.250
My Lady,

07:50.430 --> 07:51.480
how could you do

07:51.600 --> 07:53.240
such labor yourself?

07:53.240 --> 07:54.370
Let me do it instead,

07:54.430 --> 07:55.960
so you won't hurt yourself.

07:56.830 --> 07:57.720
Yimeng,

07:57.720 --> 07:59.920
I heard that after
the ladies left that day,

07:59.920 --> 08:01.720
you had quite a talk with Heng.

08:02.190 --> 08:03.800
Have you changed your mind?

08:04.390 --> 08:05.190
My Lady,

08:05.800 --> 08:07.680
I was foolish before.

08:07.750 --> 08:09.360
The Seventh Prince is
such a wonderful person,

08:09.360 --> 08:10.950
and I failed to cherish him.

08:11.390 --> 08:12.360
Thanks to you

08:12.360 --> 08:13.760
for never giving up on me,

08:13.800 --> 08:15.660
I now have the chance to marry him.

08:16.680 --> 08:18.510
It's just...

08:20.120 --> 08:20.920
What's wrong?

08:21.560 --> 08:23.120
Has Heng mistreated you?

08:24.710 --> 08:25.700
No,

08:26.000 --> 08:28.000
His Highness hasn't mistreated me.

08:29.000 --> 08:29.800
My Lady,

08:30.120 --> 08:32.049
after meeting those noble ladies,

08:32.110 --> 08:34.110
he started ignoring me completely.

08:34.360 --> 08:35.789
I followed your instructions

08:35.789 --> 08:37.390
and gave him those pastries,

08:37.510 --> 08:39.080
but after taking them,

08:39.840 --> 08:41.480
he just turned and left,

08:41.549 --> 08:44.430
without saying a single kind word to me.

08:45.390 --> 08:46.720
I'm worried

08:46.720 --> 08:48.910
that he might've taken a fancy to
one of those noble ladies

08:48.910 --> 08:51.040
and is thinking of taking a concubine.

08:51.140 --> 08:52.400
That's impossible.

08:53.200 --> 08:54.840
Those ladies that day

08:54.840 --> 08:56.620
were all terrified by Heng.

08:56.720 --> 08:59.870
In this capital, the only woman
with such courage

09:00.390 --> 09:01.790
is you, Yimeng.

09:02.780 --> 09:04.110
Thank you, My Lady.

09:04.790 --> 09:07.080
That's what I've been telling myself too.

09:07.080 --> 09:07.870
But...

09:08.790 --> 09:11.480
But as long as I'm not by his side,

09:11.600 --> 09:13.840
I can neither eat nor sleep properly.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.550
I'm afraid

09:15.750 --> 09:17.540
that I might pass away

09:17.630 --> 09:19.670
before our wedding day arrives.

09:20.790 --> 09:21.600
Yimeng.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.200
Yimeng.

09:28.440 --> 09:29.380
Yimeng!

09:29.480 --> 09:30.310
Yimeng!

09:34.910 --> 09:35.720
Quick!

09:35.870 --> 09:36.790
Quickly call the imperial physician!

09:36.790 --> 09:37.120
Yes,

09:37.120 --> 09:37.720
My Lady.

09:39.080 --> 09:40.150
All illnesses can be cured,

09:40.150 --> 09:41.550
but lovesickness has no remedy.

09:41.550 --> 09:42.320
My Lady,

09:42.320 --> 09:43.510
I beg you.

09:43.600 --> 09:44.960
Please let me go to the Prince's residence

09:44.960 --> 09:46.360
to be with the Seventh Prince,

09:46.360 --> 09:47.120
would you?

09:49.200 --> 09:50.350
Good child,

09:50.390 --> 09:51.900
I promise you.

09:51.920 --> 09:54.150
I'll grant you anything you wish.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.720
Thank you, My Lady.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.480
My Lady,

10:01.910 --> 10:03.510
your acting was terrible.

10:03.510 --> 10:05.200
Why don't you learn from me sometime?

10:05.200 --> 10:06.670
You have the nerve to say that?

10:06.670 --> 10:08.390
You put chili sauce in there.

10:08.390 --> 10:10.240
I wonder if she noticed.

10:11.150 --> 10:12.320
Whatever.

10:12.630 --> 10:13.960
Both of you, listen carefully.

10:13.960 --> 10:15.030
From now on,

10:15.030 --> 10:16.000
I'll keep a close eye

10:16.000 --> 10:16.750
on Nan Heng.

10:16.750 --> 10:17.510
You two

10:17.510 --> 10:19.040
watch Song Yiting closely.

10:22.790 --> 10:24.860
Yimeng is so desperate

10:24.960 --> 10:26.700
to leave the palace and see Heng

10:26.790 --> 10:29.120
that she'd go to such lengths.

10:29.120 --> 10:31.030
Miss Song has gone to great trouble.

10:31.030 --> 10:34.600
She must be deeply in love
with His Highness.

10:35.360 --> 10:36.910
Love grows deeply,

10:37.240 --> 10:38.840
blossoms, and bears fruits.

10:38.870 --> 10:40.400
They'll have many children

10:40.460 --> 10:41.960
and many generations!

10:51.600 --> 10:52.600
So you

10:53.240 --> 10:55.170
took the initiative to tell Mother

10:56.080 --> 10:56.960
to come

10:57.670 --> 10:59.030
and serve me?

11:02.600 --> 11:04.440
Your Highness is busy.

11:04.910 --> 11:06.910
Since I'm about to become your wife,

11:07.440 --> 11:09.000
I need to learn

11:09.480 --> 11:11.510
how to serve you well.

11:13.510 --> 11:14.750
Then in the future,

11:15.480 --> 11:18.980
I can pass down your genes,

11:19.080 --> 11:20.550
blossom and bear fruit,

11:20.550 --> 11:22.120
and have many children

11:22.120 --> 11:23.480
and generations.

11:23.480 --> 11:23.840
Got it.

11:23.840 --> 11:24.670
Then...

11:27.080 --> 11:28.080
You may leave.

11:32.620 --> 11:34.900
Did I do something wrong?

11:35.440 --> 11:36.510
Or Your Highness,

11:37.440 --> 11:39.480
do you not want to see me at all?

11:45.320 --> 11:46.120
Fine.

11:46.640 --> 11:47.790
If you are well,

11:48.120 --> 11:49.320
everything is great.

11:50.840 --> 11:52.350
I'll leave now.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.240
From now on,

11:54.840 --> 11:57.240
I won't disturb your life anymore.

12:06.200 --> 12:07.630
I'm really leaving.

12:15.960 --> 12:18.090
You said you cared about me.

12:18.510 --> 12:21.600
You said you wanted to
protect me forever.

12:22.630 --> 12:24.210
People change easily,

12:24.320 --> 12:25.840
but love is hard to break.

12:26.200 --> 12:28.810
What a pity for my sincerity.

12:29.150 --> 12:31.550
I loved the wrong person.

12:31.630 --> 12:32.710
Come back.

12:37.200 --> 12:38.860
What's wrong, Your Highness?

12:43.080 --> 12:44.410
Your acting is not good.

12:45.720 --> 12:46.960
Don't act next time.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.260
However,

12:49.790 --> 12:51.550
since you've already spoken
with Mother,

12:51.550 --> 12:53.440
you should stay here in the residence.

12:53.440 --> 12:55.300
It's not safe outside these days.

12:55.320 --> 12:56.120
Don't go out

12:56.910 --> 12:58.320
and cause me trouble,

12:58.960 --> 12:59.750
understand?

13:01.210 --> 13:02.990
I got it.

13:03.150 --> 13:05.480
Your Highness is truly

13:05.480 --> 13:07.080
the best fiancé in the world.

13:07.640 --> 13:09.370
I'll go settle in now.

13:55.440 --> 13:56.300
Your Highness,

13:56.600 --> 13:57.930
what are you looking at?

13:58.630 --> 14:00.630
What's so interesting about hands?

14:02.910 --> 14:03.720
What is it?

14:04.670 --> 14:05.720
Chancellor Gao has brought his advisors

14:05.720 --> 14:06.790
to discuss state affairs with you.

14:06.790 --> 14:08.650
They're waiting in the main hall.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.390
Got it.

14:12.510 --> 14:13.370
Your Highness,

14:13.550 --> 14:16.030
Chu Guihong just came to steal something,

14:16.230 --> 14:18.150
and now Miss Song comes to stay.

14:18.150 --> 14:19.600
What's going on here?

14:20.550 --> 14:22.950
She says she's here to
serve me personally,

14:23.200 --> 14:25.800
but there's not a word of truth
in what she says.

14:27.080 --> 14:28.120
Keep an eye on her.

14:28.840 --> 14:30.100
If she needs anything,

14:30.270 --> 14:32.200
make sure it's properly arranged.

14:32.320 --> 14:33.030
But Your Highness,

14:33.030 --> 14:35.230
your instructions are contradictory.

14:35.600 --> 14:36.750
Should I be guarding against her

14:36.750 --> 14:38.080
or taking care of her?

14:42.510 --> 14:44.080
You've been with me for so long.

14:44.080 --> 14:46.000
Don't you know how to be flexible?

14:48.050 --> 14:54.010
[Brilliant Heavenly Sun]

14:49.480 --> 14:50.340
Your Highness.

14:50.510 --> 14:51.390
I'm slow.

14:51.390 --> 14:53.120
Please give me another chance.

14:53.120 --> 14:53.980
Your Highness!

14:56.740 --> 14:57.550
Miss Song.

15:12.750 --> 15:15.280
Nan Heng definitely started
seducing Yiting

15:15.320 --> 15:17.380
by exchanging love letters with her.

15:19.480 --> 15:20.360
Not it.

15:31.550 --> 15:34.610
His Highness had half a bowl
of porridge for breakfast.

15:36.480 --> 15:39.390
[Peace and Serenity]

15:36.670 --> 15:37.480
Miss Song,

15:37.510 --> 15:38.550
this is a private study.

15:38.550 --> 15:39.880
What are you doing here?

15:40.030 --> 15:40.980
I'm

15:41.440 --> 15:42.480
just looking around.

15:42.480 --> 15:44.480
His Highness told me
to get familiar with my surroundings.

15:44.480 --> 15:45.390
I'm going

15:45.390 --> 15:46.960
to explore elsewhere now.

15:55.080 --> 15:55.940
Your Highness,

15:56.270 --> 15:57.080
Chancellor.

15:58.080 --> 16:00.030
Getting married and receiving a fief

16:00.030 --> 16:02.160
is a custom from the previous dynasty,

16:02.200 --> 16:04.510
but there are also precedents
that can be followed.

16:04.510 --> 16:08.400
If you wish to legitimately
bypass this rule,

16:08.480 --> 16:10.080
the only way is...

16:14.360 --> 16:16.020
By becoming the crown prince.

16:28.600 --> 16:30.750
But currently among the six ministries,

16:30.750 --> 16:32.200
only the Minister of Revenue is

16:32.200 --> 16:33.720
willing to support me.

16:34.790 --> 16:37.360
If I propose to be named crown prince now,

16:38.440 --> 16:39.630
I fear Mr. Song

16:39.630 --> 16:42.690
will think my intention to marry
Song Yimeng is impure.

16:46.910 --> 16:49.240
Isn't this precisely why you are marrying

16:50.270 --> 16:51.840
Minister Song's eldest daughter?

16:51.840 --> 16:52.720
Indeed.

16:52.790 --> 16:56.240
Otherwise, why would you marry Miss Song?

16:56.240 --> 16:56.790
Yes.

16:56.790 --> 16:57.840
That's right.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.130
That's the reasoning.

16:59.790 --> 17:00.600
Enough.

17:02.480 --> 17:04.010
I'll make my own judgment on this matter.

17:04.010 --> 17:05.010
You all may leave.

17:06.510 --> 17:07.310
Yes.

17:32.400 --> 17:33.200
Uncle,

17:34.200 --> 17:35.600
is there something else?

17:38.000 --> 17:41.310
You originally had two goals in forcing
the marriage with Song Yimeng.

17:41.310 --> 17:43.550
First, to break up the alliance
between the Song and Chu families.

17:43.550 --> 17:45.750
Second, to gain Song Yude's support.

17:45.880 --> 17:47.000
Now that Song Yimeng

17:47.000 --> 17:49.240
will definitely break off the engagement
with Chu Guihong,

17:49.240 --> 17:51.640
the Song-Chu alliance exists in name only.

17:51.920 --> 17:54.070
However, Song Yimeng
has always been willful,

17:54.070 --> 17:55.880
and I fear there will be
too many variables.

17:55.880 --> 17:57.030
I believe...

17:59.400 --> 18:01.700
You should change course

18:02.350 --> 18:03.680
and seek another bride.

18:05.270 --> 18:06.950
Haven't I told you before?

18:07.440 --> 18:08.310
Political struggles

18:08.310 --> 18:10.200
are best fought in court.

18:10.310 --> 18:12.110
Marriage is merely an external factor.

18:12.110 --> 18:14.710
Uncle, you needn't worry
about these matters.

18:14.720 --> 18:16.400
Could it be that you have
feelings for Song Yimeng?

18:16.400 --> 18:17.680
Regarding the provincial assignment,

18:17.680 --> 18:19.140
I'll find my own solution.

18:25.110 --> 18:26.710
If this woman isn't removed,

18:26.960 --> 18:29.090
she will surely become great trouble.

18:33.400 --> 18:34.200
Come here.

18:40.440 --> 18:41.240
Consort.

18:41.830 --> 18:42.640
To-be.

18:43.680 --> 18:44.550
Consort-to-be.

18:44.550 --> 18:45.480
Consort-to-be.

18:46.510 --> 18:47.640
You must be tired after a long day.

18:47.640 --> 18:48.270
Here,

18:48.350 --> 18:49.610
have something to eat.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.510
I prepared this specially for you two.

18:51.510 --> 18:52.310
Thank you.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.200
Thank you.

18:54.440 --> 18:57.440
Where does His Highness
frequently visit these days?

18:57.550 --> 18:59.480
Could you tell me a little about it?

18:59.790 --> 19:00.590
Well...

19:01.000 --> 19:01.930
Consort-to-be,

19:02.240 --> 19:03.960
His Highness's whereabouts
are confidential.

19:03.960 --> 19:05.480
If we were to reveal anything,

19:05.480 --> 19:06.810
it could cost our lives.

19:07.110 --> 19:08.440
Listen to yourself.

19:08.810 --> 19:10.590
You make us sound like strangers.

19:10.590 --> 19:12.000
He is the prince

19:12.000 --> 19:13.270
and I am his consort.

19:13.270 --> 19:15.270
Aren't you just the Consort-to-be?

19:16.440 --> 19:18.210
Why are you being so stubborn?

19:18.310 --> 19:20.400
Even with the "to-be," I'm still
a consort, aren't I?

19:20.400 --> 19:21.400
Telling outsiders

19:21.400 --> 19:22.640
would be leaking information.

19:22.640 --> 19:24.030
But telling family

19:24.030 --> 19:25.940
is just everyday sharing.

19:27.700 --> 19:28.620
Fine, fine,

19:29.000 --> 19:30.660
I won't pressure you anymore.

19:31.030 --> 19:32.790
You just have to tell me now

19:33.310 --> 19:34.240
if the prince

19:34.550 --> 19:37.000
has been frequently visiting
the Song family these days,

19:37.000 --> 19:38.440
especially going to see—

19:38.440 --> 19:39.170
Song Yimeng,

19:39.590 --> 19:40.510
are you here to take care of me

19:40.510 --> 19:41.910
or the horses?

19:42.010 --> 19:43.870
What are you doing in the stables?

19:44.310 --> 19:45.330
Your Highness.

19:45.720 --> 19:47.780
Your Highness, how come you're here?

19:48.400 --> 19:49.200
Be serious.

19:50.510 --> 19:51.310
I just

19:51.920 --> 19:54.680
want to know everything
about you, that's all.

19:57.920 --> 19:59.270
So that's why

20:00.790 --> 20:02.450
you went snooping in my study?

20:05.960 --> 20:07.360
Well, I couldn't exactly

20:07.790 --> 20:10.000
go snooping in your bedroom, could I?

20:15.030 --> 20:16.350
Behave yourself.

20:17.480 --> 20:18.880
Go wait for me in the room.

20:19.610 --> 20:21.070
I'll deal with you later.

20:24.960 --> 20:26.350
As you wish, Your Highness.

20:26.350 --> 20:27.510
I'll take my leave.

20:29.550 --> 20:30.410
Your Highness.

20:30.830 --> 20:32.360
She's trying to seduce you.

20:32.470 --> 20:34.550
Should I go test her intentions?

20:35.540 --> 20:36.880
You test her?

20:37.590 --> 20:38.640
What exactly would you test?

20:38.640 --> 20:39.960
What could you possibly test?

20:39.960 --> 20:40.750
Well...

20:40.920 --> 20:42.920
Since you have nothing better to do,

20:42.960 --> 20:43.680
go feed the horses.

20:43.680 --> 20:44.920
Yes, sir.

20:45.920 --> 20:46.720
Test her?

20:52.510 --> 20:53.310
What are you looking at?

20:53.310 --> 20:54.370
Go feed the horses!

20:57.000 --> 20:58.400
The horses have already been fed.

20:58.400 --> 21:00.660
I'm more worried the man is still hungry.

21:01.880 --> 21:03.290
I can't believe this.

21:03.400 --> 21:04.830
Nan Heng is so cunning,

21:04.880 --> 21:06.440
hiding things so well.

21:06.680 --> 21:08.070
Good thing I'm quick-witted

21:08.070 --> 21:09.150
and good at acting.

21:42.590 --> 21:44.180
Oh my goodness,

21:44.550 --> 21:46.480
I actually found it.

21:50.240 --> 21:51.570
Wait, that's not right.

21:51.750 --> 21:54.550
Both men and women have
long hair in ancient times,

21:54.890 --> 21:56.150
so this doesn't count.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.560
What are you looking for?

22:24.550 --> 22:26.090
I just wanted to see

22:26.200 --> 22:28.900
if you sleep on a soft or firm bed.

22:29.200 --> 22:30.440
If it's too soft,

22:30.440 --> 22:32.830
I thought I could replace it
with a firmer one

22:32.830 --> 22:34.490
as it's not good for your back.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.260
If you want something,

22:38.720 --> 22:40.160
just tell me directly.

22:40.590 --> 22:42.000
There's no need for this.

22:43.400 --> 22:45.800
Besides, no one likes feeling distrusted,

22:46.240 --> 22:47.270
especially me.

22:50.880 --> 22:52.640
And especially by you.

23:03.090 --> 23:03.980
I...

23:05.160 --> 23:06.410
I didn't!

23:06.490 --> 23:11.470
[Heaven-Heard]

23:53.400 --> 23:54.380
Big, big, big!

23:54.440 --> 23:55.200
Open!

23:55.200 --> 23:56.880
Big, big, big!

23:58.270 --> 23:58.680
Open!

23:58.680 --> 23:59.590
Open it!

23:59.790 --> 24:00.410
Open it!

24:00.480 --> 24:01.990
I won!

24:02.200 --> 24:03.400
I won!

24:03.480 --> 24:04.500
Come on,

24:04.590 --> 24:05.480
pay up!

24:08.960 --> 24:09.820
Let's go again!

24:09.880 --> 24:10.830
Mr. Li,

24:11.270 --> 24:12.200
is this how

24:12.310 --> 24:13.920
you usually live your life?

24:14.070 --> 24:15.050
Yeah.

24:15.220 --> 24:18.830
People of the martial arts world
seek freedom, pleasure,

24:18.920 --> 24:20.000
wine, women, wealth, and excitement.

24:20.000 --> 24:22.580
I'm quite accomplished in all of them.

24:22.680 --> 24:23.480
What's wrong?

24:24.070 --> 24:25.670
You don't like it, Miss Song?

24:25.750 --> 24:27.680
If you don't like it, wait outside.

24:29.030 --> 24:31.630
We agreed on three days for me
to make my choice,

24:32.150 --> 24:33.650
but it hasn't even been one day

24:33.650 --> 24:35.170
and you're already fed up?

24:41.310 --> 24:43.040
Anyone else want to place a bet?

24:43.200 --> 24:44.590
Hurry up if you're betting!

24:44.590 --> 24:45.650
Mr. Li,

24:45.920 --> 24:48.160
this is getting boring.

24:48.400 --> 24:50.030
Let's make a bigger wager.

24:50.240 --> 24:51.630
What do you have in mind?

24:52.960 --> 24:55.110
This is my family heirloom sword,

24:55.110 --> 24:56.370
the Mountain Cleaver.

24:56.440 --> 24:58.030
It's worth a fortune.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.550
On top of that,

24:59.920 --> 25:01.230
one house,

25:01.250 --> 25:02.730
five acres of land,

25:02.960 --> 25:04.760
and my two hands.

25:04.880 --> 25:07.000
Let's settle it in one round.

25:11.740 --> 25:13.950
That's a fine sword,

25:14.070 --> 25:15.200
but unfortunately,

25:15.750 --> 25:17.440
I have nothing of value to wager,

25:17.440 --> 25:19.590
so I can't join the game.

25:20.510 --> 25:23.360
I have no interest in gold or treasures.

25:24.960 --> 25:27.400
This woman, however, would do nicely.

25:28.160 --> 25:29.960
I can see she's elegant,

25:29.960 --> 25:31.440
refined,

25:31.480 --> 25:32.810
and worth gambling for.

25:38.510 --> 25:39.310
Sure.

25:39.810 --> 25:40.720
He agreed!

25:42.830 --> 25:44.350
You're using me as a wager?

25:44.440 --> 25:45.240
Yeah.

25:45.440 --> 25:47.640
You're the one who insisted
on following me.

25:47.640 --> 25:48.790
Since you're mine,

25:48.790 --> 25:50.270
what's wrong with using you as a wager?

25:50.270 --> 25:51.400
If you don't like it,

25:51.750 --> 25:53.080
you can still leave now.

26:00.030 --> 26:00.590
Fine.

26:01.610 --> 26:02.480
Since I'm at the table,

26:02.480 --> 26:04.030
there's no reason to quit halfway.

26:04.030 --> 26:04.680
Yes.

26:05.880 --> 26:06.680
Wagering me

26:06.680 --> 26:07.350
is fine,

26:07.510 --> 26:10.000
but I'll hold the cards myself.

26:15.330 --> 26:17.190
Double axes?

26:34.260 --> 26:35.480
-Royal flush?
-Royal flush!

26:35.480 --> 26:37.080
-Royal flush?
-Royal flush!

26:37.880 --> 26:39.070
This...

26:48.880 --> 26:50.590
Bring that sword over here.

26:55.070 --> 26:55.880
Please have someone

26:55.880 --> 26:57.070
from the store bring this sword

26:57.070 --> 26:59.740
and these items to my residence.

27:00.750 --> 27:02.560
These hands he wagered

27:03.110 --> 27:04.710
will serve as labor payment.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.160
Help yourself.

27:08.550 --> 27:09.810
Miss Song Yiting,

27:10.030 --> 27:11.160
I had no idea

27:11.830 --> 27:13.630
you were such a skilled gambler.

27:14.180 --> 27:15.510
It's just mathematics.

27:16.230 --> 27:17.760
Anyone with hands can do it.

27:18.400 --> 27:19.200
Also,

27:20.000 --> 27:21.160
take off your hat.

27:35.880 --> 27:38.950
If you want to set up a trap
to scare me off next time,

27:38.980 --> 27:41.090
at least use some fresh faces.

27:41.270 --> 27:43.000
I've seen this person many times before.

27:43.000 --> 27:43.930
Don't you agree?

27:44.440 --> 27:45.010
I...

27:47.550 --> 27:48.440
Mr. Li,

27:48.640 --> 27:50.550
I'd like to go shopping tomorrow,

27:50.550 --> 27:53.280
and I request that you come alone
to accompany me.

28:04.750 --> 28:05.750
Shangguan.

28:07.110 --> 28:08.720
This Song Yiting

28:09.750 --> 28:11.480
is hard to deal with.

28:12.790 --> 28:14.590
We can't get the sword back.

28:15.270 --> 28:17.110
My sword is gone too.

28:19.230 --> 28:20.800
And my house,

28:21.580 --> 28:22.740
my land,

28:23.350 --> 28:24.850
and my...

28:25.480 --> 28:26.520
Beard.

28:37.110 --> 28:38.930
Judging by Nan Heng's reaction,

28:39.110 --> 28:40.570
he was clearly panicking.

28:40.790 --> 28:43.920
There must be something suspicious
in that bedside box.

28:52.510 --> 28:53.590
Love letters?

28:55.590 --> 28:56.400
A token?

29:00.200 --> 29:01.260
It can't be

29:02.200 --> 29:04.130
an aphrodisiac for Yiting, right?

29:07.110 --> 29:08.240
Let go of me!

29:08.240 --> 29:09.240
Let go!

29:09.350 --> 29:10.750
Let go of me!

29:24.060 --> 29:25.520
Since you're being cruel,

29:25.640 --> 29:27.570
don't blame me for being disloyal.

29:28.310 --> 29:29.480
Nan,

29:30.070 --> 29:32.030
you forced me to do this.

29:39.270 --> 29:40.030
Come.

29:40.030 --> 29:40.790
Come.

29:41.720 --> 29:42.510
Sir,

29:42.590 --> 29:44.070
I've heard that this place

29:44.070 --> 29:46.190
is the largest clinic in the capital.

29:47.270 --> 29:49.240
If I wanted some of that...

29:50.200 --> 29:51.000
You know...

29:51.720 --> 29:53.200
That special medicine,

29:53.270 --> 29:54.870
would you happen to have any?

29:57.270 --> 29:58.640
I'm very knowledgable about

29:58.640 --> 29:59.880
these domestic affairs.

29:59.880 --> 30:02.270
Are you looking for fertility medicine,

30:02.270 --> 30:04.680
or perhaps abortion pills?

30:04.920 --> 30:06.070
What are you thinking?

30:06.070 --> 30:06.960
It's neither.

30:07.400 --> 30:08.680
I want something that

30:08.750 --> 30:10.830
makes someone abstain from women,

30:10.830 --> 30:11.880
purifies their mind, and reduces desires,

30:11.880 --> 30:15.680
preferably something that would make them
become a monk on the spot.

30:17.030 --> 30:20.980
[Song Residence]

30:23.000 --> 30:23.790
Shangguan,

30:24.270 --> 30:26.330
Miss Song Yiting is about to come out.

30:26.790 --> 30:28.270
Before you put on your battle robe,

30:28.270 --> 30:30.640
please repeat today's mission once more.

30:32.070 --> 30:32.880
Alright.

30:34.440 --> 30:36.240
Combining our Chief's arrogance,

30:36.240 --> 30:37.610
Nan Rui's ignorance,

30:37.790 --> 30:39.970
and Chu Guihong's dullness,

30:40.270 --> 30:43.200
I vow to be the most detestable man
in Great Jing.

30:43.550 --> 30:45.400
I will surely destroy

30:46.590 --> 30:48.190
Miss Song's feelings for me.

30:49.070 --> 30:51.130
Everything depends on this one move.

30:57.380 --> 30:59.170
♪ Oh my, baby ♪

30:59.750 --> 31:02.130
♪ What earrings do you like this time? ♪

31:00.250 --> 31:01.900
[400 copper coins]

31:01.350 --> 31:02.310
So expensive.

31:02.720 --> 31:04.440
♪ Such expensive earrings are puzzling ♪

31:04.690 --> 31:07.500
♪ Do they think it rains money? ♪

31:06.180 --> 31:07.900
[Jewelry]

31:08.220 --> 31:10.250
♪ It rains money ♪

31:10.110 --> 31:11.400
So ugly.

31:10.930 --> 31:13.060
♪ Sploosh, splash ♪

31:13.710 --> 31:15.890
♪ It rains money ♪

31:16.530 --> 31:18.330
♪ I'm getting rich, I'm getting rich ♪

31:56.140 --> 31:58.230
[Jewelry Shop]

31:58.350 --> 31:59.490
Why are you

31:59.640 --> 32:00.900
holding the packages?

32:01.070 --> 32:01.960
Oh, right.

32:03.250 --> 32:09.330
[Candle Shop]

32:31.720 --> 32:32.720
Does it look nice?

32:33.070 --> 32:36.110
I want to wear this tomorrow
when I meet my friends.

32:37.030 --> 32:37.830
It's ugly.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.680
Extremely ugly.

32:41.270 --> 32:43.600
You're wearing this to meet your friends?

32:44.640 --> 32:47.570
People might think you're
trying to seduce someone.

32:53.030 --> 32:55.200
And you call yourself a noble lady?

32:56.830 --> 32:58.050
In my opinion,

32:58.720 --> 33:00.990
you're nothing but a vulgar woman

33:01.070 --> 33:03.160
who tries to win over men.

33:18.270 --> 33:18.960
What else do you need to buy?

33:18.960 --> 33:20.070
Can you hurry up?

33:20.480 --> 33:22.810
Waning River Crescent has a meeting soon.

33:25.160 --> 33:27.650
A successful man like myself

33:27.830 --> 33:28.680
simply doesn't have time

33:28.680 --> 33:30.830
to waste on such shallow matters.

33:30.920 --> 33:31.720
Enough.

33:33.640 --> 33:34.720
If your goal

33:35.160 --> 33:36.560
is to make me dislike you,

33:37.030 --> 33:38.240
then congratulations.

33:38.240 --> 33:39.300
You've succeeded.

33:42.000 --> 33:44.260
Don't bother accompanying me tomorrow.

34:04.480 --> 34:06.440
Besides the one Miss Song Yiting
is wearing,

34:06.440 --> 34:08.280
this one is for you.

34:09.110 --> 34:10.110
For me?

34:12.670 --> 34:16.420
[Half a month ago]

34:16.480 --> 34:18.940
The men's and women's outfits
really match!

34:19.480 --> 34:21.840
Mr. Li is a person of integrity.

34:22.400 --> 34:24.880
This blue color suits him perfectly.

34:26.400 --> 34:27.920
He often engages in martial arts contests,

34:27.920 --> 34:29.510
so his clothes can't just look good.

34:29.510 --> 34:30.670
They must also be durable

34:30.670 --> 34:31.670
and lightweight.

34:32.230 --> 34:34.670
Areas that touch the skin,
like the cuffs and collars,

34:34.670 --> 34:36.130
must be crafted with care.

34:38.070 --> 34:38.880
Madam,

34:39.360 --> 34:41.840
I need your help with something.

34:42.670 --> 34:43.650
Go ahead.

34:44.190 --> 34:46.860
Mr. Li has a condition on his face

34:46.960 --> 34:49.090
and doesn't show his true appearance.

34:49.510 --> 34:50.639
But I believe

34:50.760 --> 34:53.070
he is the most handsome man in the world.

34:53.840 --> 34:55.400
Only the most vivid mask

34:55.840 --> 34:57.100
would be worthy of him.

34:59.190 --> 35:00.510
These are my designs.

35:03.050 --> 35:04.110
Take it!

35:04.800 --> 35:07.030
I've run this tailor shop for many years,

35:07.030 --> 35:09.000
and Miss Song Yiting is
a regular customer,

35:09.000 --> 35:11.710
but I've never seen her care
so much about someone.

35:11.710 --> 35:12.920
Such fine things

35:12.920 --> 35:14.630
are wasted on someone like you.

35:14.630 --> 35:15.230
Pah!

35:15.400 --> 35:16.730
I don't want your money.

35:27.890 --> 35:31.950
[Righteousness and Virtue]

35:51.000 --> 35:52.180
This is...

35:54.230 --> 35:55.030
A tonic?

35:56.480 --> 35:57.280
Miss Song,

35:57.400 --> 35:58.260
isn't this bowl

35:58.340 --> 36:00.140
a bit too large?

36:00.230 --> 36:01.540
I came here

36:01.760 --> 36:03.550
specifically to take care of

36:03.550 --> 36:04.550
His Highness's health.

36:04.550 --> 36:06.110
Without some strong medicine,

36:06.110 --> 36:07.840
how can I properly nourish him?

36:08.440 --> 36:09.360
Your Highness,

36:09.630 --> 36:11.360
please drink it while it's hot.

36:11.400 --> 36:12.360
If it gets cold,

36:12.800 --> 36:15.000
the medicinal effects won't be as good.

36:16.550 --> 36:17.510
Drink up now.

36:20.510 --> 36:23.240
So what exactly are the effects
of this medicine?

36:24.590 --> 36:25.850
It nourishes

36:26.400 --> 36:28.230
the heart, liver, spleen,
lungs, and kidneys—

36:28.230 --> 36:29.110
everything.

36:29.280 --> 36:30.960
It's good for your health.

36:30.960 --> 36:31.710
Drink it quickly.

36:31.710 --> 36:33.910
Are you trying to make him plump like me?

36:35.400 --> 36:36.400
You're too young.

36:36.400 --> 36:37.660
You don't understand.

36:38.480 --> 36:40.080
I don't think this is a tonic.

36:40.550 --> 36:42.750
You're trying to poison me, aren't you?

36:43.190 --> 36:44.000
I...

36:45.760 --> 36:46.680
Your Highness,

36:47.030 --> 36:49.670
for the sake of my future happiness,

36:50.070 --> 36:52.020
I certainly wouldn't harm you.

36:56.880 --> 36:58.480
Excessive eagerness to help

36:58.760 --> 37:00.220
means you're up to no good.

37:01.070 --> 37:01.760
Your Highness,

37:01.760 --> 37:03.020
let me taste it for you.

37:03.400 --> 37:04.190
No!

37:05.150 --> 37:06.360
You can't drink it.

37:06.360 --> 37:07.320
It's such expensive medicine.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.820
How can you drink it?

37:09.030 --> 37:10.030
You're too young.

37:10.550 --> 37:11.440
This medicine

37:12.070 --> 37:13.470
is only for His Highness.

37:15.320 --> 37:16.180
Your Highness,

37:16.670 --> 37:17.710
let me

37:18.070 --> 37:19.670
help you take your medicine.

37:23.710 --> 37:24.510
Alright.

37:28.920 --> 37:29.710
Come,

37:30.480 --> 37:31.410
open your mouth.

37:32.800 --> 37:34.480
You're too far. I can't reach.

37:36.550 --> 37:37.820
Come, be a good boy.

37:38.110 --> 37:39.240
Open your mouth.

37:40.680 --> 37:41.790
Still can't reach.

37:43.360 --> 37:44.150
Come closer.

37:50.880 --> 37:51.740
Your Highness,

37:52.000 --> 37:53.280
please take your medicine.

37:53.280 --> 37:54.110
Wait.

37:55.110 --> 37:56.170
Sit here to feed me.

37:57.070 --> 37:57.880
Sit?

37:59.300 --> 38:00.060
Sit?

38:03.960 --> 38:05.420
Is this really necessary?

38:05.440 --> 38:06.670
Whether it's necessary or not

38:06.670 --> 38:07.400
depends on how badly

38:07.400 --> 38:09.590
you want me to take this medicine.

38:13.150 --> 38:13.960
Fine!

38:17.880 --> 38:19.360
Then I'll sit here

38:19.390 --> 38:21.320
and feed you your medicine slowly.

38:33.360 --> 38:34.850
Come on, Your Highness.

38:35.480 --> 38:37.190
Can you drink it now?

38:40.960 --> 38:42.690
You're still not close enough.

38:45.960 --> 38:46.820
Your Highness,

38:47.000 --> 38:49.800
aren't you afraid I might

38:49.800 --> 38:52.400
shove this spoon right down your throat?

38:53.670 --> 38:54.730
You wouldn't dare.

38:55.920 --> 38:56.710
Fine then.

38:57.760 --> 38:59.590
Let's see

38:59.800 --> 39:01.480
whether I dare or not.

39:02.320 --> 39:03.110
Come on, be good,

39:03.110 --> 39:04.040
open your mouth.

39:05.510 --> 39:06.840
Is this close enough?

39:07.550 --> 39:08.480
Close enough?

39:09.070 --> 39:09.880
Here,

39:10.070 --> 39:12.030
time for your medicine.

39:12.030 --> 39:12.760
I...

39:12.880 --> 39:13.960
Come on.

39:19.360 --> 39:20.150
I'm sorry,

39:20.400 --> 39:21.330
my foot slipped.

39:22.550 --> 39:24.550
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

39:28.480 --> 39:29.280
What...

39:29.280 --> 39:30.340
What are you doing?

39:30.550 --> 39:33.280
Next time you want to throw yourself
into my arms,

39:33.400 --> 39:34.190
remember to

39:35.150 --> 39:36.510
dress more elegantly.

39:37.070 --> 39:37.590
I...

39:54.930 --> 39:56.350
Take it easy.

40:02.060 --> 40:04.860
Miss Song Yiting showed me
nothing but sincerity,

40:05.800 --> 40:08.330
yet I threw her genuine feelings
on the ground

40:08.840 --> 40:10.700
and trampled on them carelessly.

40:11.000 --> 40:13.600
Even the wickedest person
in the martial world

40:14.710 --> 40:16.400
couldn't be worse than me.

40:17.320 --> 40:18.620
Shangguan,

40:19.110 --> 40:20.440
don't think too much.

40:20.670 --> 40:22.280
You were just doing your job.

40:22.280 --> 40:23.280
You didn't want to do that,

40:23.280 --> 40:24.000
right?

40:24.360 --> 40:25.150
Tomorrow

40:25.590 --> 40:26.800
is the last day.

40:27.030 --> 40:27.840
Get

40:28.230 --> 40:29.190
the sword back.

40:29.590 --> 40:30.400
Never

40:30.840 --> 40:31.710
see her again.

40:33.110 --> 40:34.570
That's right, Shangguan.

40:34.670 --> 40:36.550
You can't be blamed for being harsh.

40:36.550 --> 40:37.710
You rejected her so clearly,

40:37.710 --> 40:39.570
yet she still kept pestering you.

40:39.760 --> 40:40.590
After all,

40:40.610 --> 40:42.880
it's just feelings from a brief encounter.

40:42.880 --> 40:44.110
How deep can it really be?

40:44.110 --> 40:45.070
She'll most likely

40:45.070 --> 40:46.550
forget all about it after a while.

40:46.550 --> 40:47.230
-Yes.
-Yes.

40:47.230 --> 40:47.670
-Yes.
-Yes.

40:47.670 --> 40:49.280
She's not like me.

40:50.110 --> 40:50.920
Shangguan,

40:51.030 --> 40:51.960
tell me,

40:52.110 --> 40:53.770
if you had met Miss Song Yiting

40:53.800 --> 40:54.760
at a different time,

40:54.760 --> 40:56.030
in a different place,

40:56.150 --> 40:57.550
would you have fallen for

40:57.550 --> 40:58.590
a girl like her?

41:05.670 --> 41:08.590
She's in love with the fake Li Shiliu.

41:09.550 --> 41:10.930
A person like me

41:11.320 --> 41:13.070
will never get married.

41:14.230 --> 41:16.430
Some relationships are not meant to be,

41:16.670 --> 41:17.950
so some questions

41:18.710 --> 41:20.000
should never be asked.

41:24.400 --> 41:25.440
What a shame.

41:28.320 --> 41:29.110
Guys,

41:29.440 --> 41:30.710
do you think the Waning River Crescent

41:30.710 --> 41:32.070
has bad feng shui?

41:33.510 --> 41:35.040
Our Chief Master is single,

41:35.150 --> 41:36.680
and so is our Second Master.

41:37.670 --> 41:38.440
If you ask me,

41:38.440 --> 41:40.030
we might as well become monks,

41:40.030 --> 41:41.960
instead of looking for some sword.

41:42.710 --> 41:43.510
So,

41:44.030 --> 41:44.960
you lost the sword?
